# Backend

- Target JDK 25 and the existing Spring Modulith modular monolith. Read `backend/AGENTS.md`.
- Cross-module use: public port or published event — never depend on another module's `.internal`.
- Prefer the smallest correct diff. No business logic in controllers; keep adapters thin.
- Do not add a module, aggregate, or public API without architecture admission (skill `spring-modulith-module` / `architecture-evolution-review`).
- No cross-schema write outside an accepted coordination mechanism (`debina-postgres-transaction-coordination`).
- GraphQL stays Query-only operational reads (ADR-N17). Commands stay REST/gRPC.
- Money movement only through `LedgerPort`. Keep the five status axes separate (`debina-payment-state-finality`).
- Resolve Spring Boot, Spring Framework, Spring Kafka and Kafka client versions from the effective Maven model before querying Context7.
